#!/bin/sh
# kColorPicker-Qt6 — color picker widget used by kImageAnnotator (and
# therefore Gwenview's image annotation support). Upstream tags default to
# Qt5; build the Qt6-capable master snapshot with BUILD_WITH_QT6.
set -e

cd "$ZPKG_SRC"/kColorPicker-*/
cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja \
	-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \
	-DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib \
	-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
	-DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=ON \
	-DBUILD_WITH_QT6=ON \
	-DBUILD_TESTING=OFF
cmake --build build
DESTDIR="$ZPKG_DESTROOT" cmake --install build
